ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FCh5LJ2qs5oQ7kNvwG_K1kf&_nc_oc=AdpI_tC9RHr32ZiK0I4gAHWgZmICBa3Q4QwuT_397Q8Poj52pAqFf5ldAeczuR8TROw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3-LIOjgPaCQ-Wc-pB69NE7k1F2YLRfDJGRrQZhZ0FlFg&oe=69E77C39"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vt7jpJUt-7gQ7kNvwGDJg5e&_nc_oc=AdrLdpVfcY48P9dKp1owXvsQSPP7CZJTTFHD4ZRA1MGb7Ux29WfQBcYihj1C-p6e_bA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3W9vjDOHaArbKwj6_tQltXmANNzpFjX0RIuC2uRll20g&oe=69E76A8F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z4cR5LHVdOcQ7kNvwG_2nXS&_nc_oc=Adry5XHm8cMs377UOKYhPZbLf_Fzhr8lWcW9KQJeZ8gsYVClLypCz3ko7ga_qx8di9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3aKUyGzil-ihCZJ4ilEOSaD2lMkYynN_caV-aleqN2dg&oe=69E7786E"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa